<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―The sun had almost completely set.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Let's head back to the Niimura main house while we can still see where we're stepping.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家玄関暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\夏菜死神透明.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Whew, good job, good job!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Right now, it's just the two of us here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It should be fine to show my bare face like this.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> eye really is a solid green."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Gazing hard into my eyes was <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What does this green eye even mean?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Aww, I'm bored! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Papa</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">my sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, none of them are here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> was apparently making the falsificaso.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
About '<STYLE ID="4">Mama</STYLE>' and '<STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE>,' I hadn't heard anything yet.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, was all of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> family at the meeting hall just now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't know if </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was there. Everyone's dressed the same. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was there! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is the only one whose Noh mask and robes are different!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There had certainly been someone in an old woman's Noh mask and black robes, but she can't tell which one is her <STYLE ID="4">mother</STYLE>?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, let's eat first! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Everyone's probably gonna be back late!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, let's."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, I was a little hungry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My appetite, at least, was apparently as hearty as ever.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then watch TV or something and wait! I'll have it ready in no time."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're making it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Of course! I may not look it, but I've got a 10-year career in helping with the housework!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
You're using that phrase wrong...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But silently watching TV would feel awkward.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'll help too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's fine, it's fine! A guest should just plop down all grand and wait!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
With that, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> disappeared into the kitchen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She really is a cheerful kid.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could she be looking out for me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe she's going out of her way so I can relax, even a little.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, sorry to keep you waiting!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\日々と泉.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\食事.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The meal set out in front of me was high quality for something prepared by <STYLE ID="1">a 10-year-old</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But all of it was stuff I'd never seen before.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Some of it's leftovers, though. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Okay then, itadakimasu!"</STYLE> [TN: itadakimasu: the words said before a meal]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, this food... what is it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Umf, thish ish the bah-be-hue of the nei-bo-hoo mou-tai, an' 'at one'sh―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>"Ah, sorry, never mind, it's fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I put my chopsticks to the unknown dishes too.<PG>
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Mm, delicious!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her cooking skills are solid, but the ingredients themselves are wonderful.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Are these ingredients caught around here?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I silently shoveled a heaping bowl of rice and the unknown dishes into my mouth.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ehehe, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, is it good?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"Ish really goo' an' delishush!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>"Ah, sorry, never mind, take your time eating!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's a little embarrassing...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you eat so much! Maybe even more than </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">my sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"By 'your sister,' you mean </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yep! She doesn't eat much normally, but she said if she wants to, she can eat as much as she likes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That slim <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, I'm small and a big eater too, so maybe it's not that strange.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Is it good?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Yeah, it's good."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was like a new bride watching her husband eat.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Is it good?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Yeah, it's good, really."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The same question again...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is it this time?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"After this, do you want a bath? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Or... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">yours </STYLE>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">tru-</STYLE>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">ly?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>That's just a dirty joke!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This kid</STYLE> is a little tiring...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And quit blushing!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Listen, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What now...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "1000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you've had a crying face this whole time, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
A crying face?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sure, I came for a funeral, so I've been careful about how I act.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Maybe it's because </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> passed away..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, that's not it. Not that kind of thing... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You're like an animal that lost its mother."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is she talking about? My family is alive and well in Motoki-cho...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I go hunting in the mountains all the time, and sometimes you find them. Animals that got separated from their mothers and look like they're about to cry. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But animals don't shed tears, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> face is the same, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, <STYLE ID="8">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> face rose in my mind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one I had always looked up to and loved so much, <STYLE ID="8">Senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">That Senpai</STYLE> was killed right in front of my eyes.<PG>
Normally, the shock would leave a person too crushed to recover.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I didn't feel much sadness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything, I had broken free of my dependence on <STYLE ID="8">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I no longer needed <STYLE ID="8">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because there was nothing left for me to fear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As long as I had this precognition...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, it was delicious. Gochisosama."</STYLE> [TN: the words said after a meal]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Holding back more than usual, I set down my chopsticks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It was nothing fancy! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Don't go crying when you're back in Motoki-cho because you miss my cooking!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Like I'd ever... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">No... cook for me again sometime."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">dear husband</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Honestly... weird kid.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―I went back upstairs and lay down in the dark room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Has had a crying face this whole time."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those words wouldn't leave my head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm not even crying...<PG>
Why am I not sad?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why can't I cry?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At <STYLE ID="8">Senpai's</STYLE> funeral too, I got through it without shedding a tear, on the <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="てい">pretense</STYLE> of it being too sudden to accept.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was crying, and so was <STYLE ID="11">Kogori-senpai's mother</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When you lose a <STYLE ID="12">best friend</STYLE> or a daughter, it's normal to end up like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had put everything into pretending to comfort the two of them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is her <STYLE ID="11">mother</STYLE> still <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="ほんそう">rushing around</STYLE> with the cleanup after the funeral, even now?<PG>
By rights, <STYLE ID="11">Senpai's mother</STYLE> would have wanted to come to <STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu Niimura's</STYLE> funeral too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I'll have to stand in for her and pray for <STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu Niimura's</STYLE> soul.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to lighten, even a little, the grief of losing a <STYLE ID="8">daughter</STYLE>, a <STYLE ID="7">best friend</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">, and a </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">husband</STYLE> all at once that <STYLE ID="11">Senpai's mother</STYLE> must be feeling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I think about what <STYLE ID="11">Akane</STYLE>-san is going through... 
{PAUSE ""}
I feel like I'm going to cry.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
Going to cry...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something's wrong...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something's wrong with me after all...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I almost cry over <STYLE ID="11">Senpai's mother</STYLE>, so why can't I cry over <STYLE ID="8">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's happened to me?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
