{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh...? You're not crying... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You've got a crying face, but you're really not crying..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No tears came from my eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm crying without shedding tears.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... when someone precious to you dies, you normally shed tears, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But... I think I've lost my tears. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Not long ago, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">someone precious to me</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> died, and yet... something's wrong with me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's okay. You've got me, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">my sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And besides..."</STYLE><PG>
