{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"And besides, there's </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　My mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is super good at listening to people! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　So you should try talking to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> about it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">She's someone I haven't met yet</STYLE>, but any mother who can raise a kid like <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> must be a wonderful person.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"When will </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">your mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> be back?"</STYLE>
